WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.750
Hi, everybody!

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.100
How we doing?

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.400
Got caffeinated?

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.400
Feeling good?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:36.400
Nice.

